* LTC6078 Unity-Gain Voltage Follower (Buffer)
* Single 5 V supply, 1 kHz / 100 mVpk sine input biased at mid-supply
* Output drives a 10 k load.  Target gain = 0 dB (Av = 1)
*
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
* Supplies
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
VCC   VCC 0 DC 5
*
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
* Input source: 2.5 V mid-supply bias + 100 mV, 1 kHz sine
* (AC 1 amplitude used for the .AC gain measurement)
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
VIN   IN  0 DC 2.5 AC 1 SINE(2.5 0.1 1k 0 0 0)
*
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
* Op amp: LTC6078 (rail-to-rail in/out, micropower)
* Pin order: +IN  -IN  V+  V-  OUT
* Unity-gain follower: output fed directly back to inverting input
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
XU1   IN  OUT VCC 0 OUT LTC6078
*
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
* Load
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
RL    OUT 0 10k
*
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
* Models
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.lib LTC.lib
*
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
* Analysis
*--------------------------------------------------------------------
.ac dec 200 1 10Meg
.meas ac gain_db find vdb(OUT) at=1k
.meas ac gain_mag find mag(V(OUT)/V(IN)) at=1k
*
* Time-domain check (uncomment to view 1 kHz sine buffering):
* .tran 0 5m 0 1u
*
.options plotwinsize=0
.end
